.prose
  :markdown
    # Test Factories

    Every test needs objects to act on, and how you make them decides
    whether the suite stays readable and fast or turns into a swamp of
    fixture files nobody dares edit. This guide covers why we use
    [factory_bot](https://github.com/thoughtbot/factory_bot), how to set it
    up with RSpec, the day-to-day API — build strategies, traits,
    associations, sequences, transients — and the habits that keep a suite
    quick as the schema grows.

